			"name": "Aspect: Striking Scorpion",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Ambush and infiltration specialists who wait, motionless, in cover for an enemy column to pass before rising, silent, to butcher it from behind.\n\nDesign: Net 2 points, per-Aspect flavour lens.",
