					"name": "Chainsword Discipline",
					"local_notes": "Lore: The chainsword is the blade a Scorpion closes with once the ambush has been sprung.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Broadsword (the Scorpion's chainsword). The mandiblasters are wargear, not a trait: see the Mandiblasters item in wargear/ranged.yaml (the earlier lens also priced them as a 3-point Innate Attack, which double counted the same weapon).",
