		{
			"id": "TOuWXzLY4paYLFUAy",
			"name": "Aspect: Warp Spider",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The strangest Aspect: warriors whose jump generators tear a short hole in real space rather than merely leap it, blinking in and out of a firefight where no jump pack could follow.\n\nDesign: Net 1 point, per-Aspect flavour lens.",
			"tags": [
				"Xenos",
				"Aeldari"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "t47u0oh_EA69SlJ3I",
					"name": "Displacement Sense",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Warp Spider who has jumped a hundred times develops a real, trained instinct for exactly when and where to trigger the next one, and the aim to put the Death Spinner's filament on target the instant they land.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Guns (Rifle), the skill the Death Spinner uses. The jump generator's own short-range teleport effect is a wargear property (a warp-technology item, not a psychic power the wearer casts) and is on that item's own entry (Warp Spider Jump Generator), per the same equipment-vs-physiology split this project's Black Carapace entry draws.",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Xenos",
						"Aeldari"
					],
					"base_points": 1,
					"features": [
